comment.narrative:
10-08-2022: During the whole project period we designed and delivered altogether five online trainings and two online workshops on the following topics (incl. nr of participants):
1. Stakeholder and partnership management: 16 participants - 10 female; 6 male;
2. Results-based management - planning: 14 participants - 8 female; 6 male;
3. Results-based management - monitoring and evaluation: 18 participants - 10 female; 8 male;
4. Advocacy and policy influencing: 16 participants - 12 female; 4 male;
5. Training of Trainers: 11 participants - 9 female; 2 male;
6. Sustainable Development Goals Game workshop: 7 participants - 5 female; 2 male;
7. MCIC strategic planning workshops resulting from RBM trainings: 16 participants - 11 female; 5 male;

Same MCIC and partner organisation's staff members participated in multiple trainings. 
Please find attached below the list of participants per training.
We did not fill in the nr. for minorities, as the total value would then not represent the correct figure on how many people participated in different trainings and workshops altogether.
